1422 0 obj
<<
/Title (These firms cater to fully independent RIAs who want infrastructure, technology, and compliance support without giving up ownership. They enable advisors to operate independently while outsourcing operational complexity. However, these models lack the capital, growth partnership, and alignment mechanisms that allow advisors to access liquidity, fund acquisitions, or participate in collective enterprise value creation at scale.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1369 0 R
/Next 1438 0 R
>>
endobj
1423 0 obj
<<
/Title (Concurrent occupies a distinct position outside these archetypes. It was built for growth-oriented advisors with entrepreneurial vision and drive. These professionals seek to scale without surrendering. Its mission is to empower builders, not buyers; to back entrepreneurs, not absorb them.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1369 0 R
/Prev 1438 0 R
>>
endobj
1424 0 obj
<<
/Title (While many in the industry are shifting toward centralized integrator models, as exemplified by recent rebranding and operational overhauls among major national RIAs,  Concurrent is intentionally swimming against the current. The firm believes scale and collaboration can be achieved without assimilation, and that diversity of brands, client niches, and business models creates strength, not friction.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1370 0 R
/Next 1439 0 R
>>
endobj
