/Title (At its core, Concurrent celebrates individuality. The platform supports a wide variety of advisory models, from investment-centric firms to holistic planners, family offices, and retirement-plan consultants. Rather than prescribing a single investment philosophy or service model, Concurrent provides the tools, scale, and guidance that allow each advisor to thrive on their own terms.)
